      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T17:33:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can add a variadic template constructor to avoid needing `std::to_array` and the extra `{`.\n\nHaven\u0027t tested, but something like this should work:\n```\ntemplate \u003ctypename... Transitions\u003e\nconstexpr FsmConfigStorage(\n  State starting_state,\n  Transitions... transitions)\n    : FsmConfigStorage(starting_state, std::to_array({transitions...})) {}\n```",
      "revId": "17c3d0573efc7e4e9254372d08c4a2592424dd37",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "33564cda_24a47246",
        "filename": "zephyr/drivers/pw_fsm/public/pw_fsm/fsm.h",
        "patchSetId": 11
